{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>七年前發生火災燒毀的日本沖繩首里城正殿完成復修，周一中午開始重新對公眾開放。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.SHURI-1830_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026YZeVfjfbYp1795432445.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>沖繩縣政府當日上午在正殿前廣場舉行開幕儀式，約500人參加。沖繩縣知事古謝玄太致辭時稱，首里城是沖繩歷史文化的象徵，重建工程令沖繩人得以重新審視珍貴的傳統文化，並在未來繼續傳承。他承諾，將致力加強防火安全工作，並對來自國內外的支持及捐款表達謝意。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.SHURI-1830.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20264FuGqFtd5w1795432462.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>首里城是歷代琉球國王居所，於14世紀末建成。2019年的大火燒毀了包括正殿在內的多棟建築，目前南殿、北殿的重建工程仍在進行。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T11:23:57.925986+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":225,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T09:07:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T13:48:37.745306+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T11:17:16.801693+00:00","content_hash":"a3fe78c8271c4b92ee6262fb782217e0f6a98f163720031eb57f2d699db19c4a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T11:23:57.925986+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}